        "next_required_object": "Compute the G3CE graph-invariance/Riccati defect and its required endpoint jets. Then evaluate or exclude det J(1) and the actual graph derivatives using the selected G3BN/G3BR endpoint actions. Without a passing dynamic identity, retain the full rank-1510 transport and use S_C(a),b_eff(a) only for static obstruction tests or preconditioning.",
